cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from 'CITATION.cff'.
type: software
title: netweather
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-11-23'
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Greg-2600/netweather'
abstract: >-
  Self-hosted internet weather station in Go that probes the public internet
  (HTTP, TLS, TCP, DNS, DoH, DoT, QUIC, NTP, ICMP) from a single hardened
  container and classifies whether an outage is widespread, limited to a
  service, or local to your connection.
authors:
  - given-names: Greg
    family-names: Baker
    alias: Greg-2600
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3931-8799'
keywords:
  - internet measurement
  - outage detection
  - Go
  - Docker
  - network monitoring
  - DNS
  - self-hosted
